Package: cpmnet
Title: Penalized Cumulative Probability Models with Elastic Net
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xuduo", "Wen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "wenv@usc.edu"))
Description: Fits cumulative probability models (CPMs) with elastic net
    penalization or regularization via block coordinate descent, computed
    along a full penalization path. Supports k-fold cross-validation for lambda
    selection under four criteria: the Brier score over a grid of
    response percentiles (default and recommended), mean and median
    regression loss, and pinball quantile loss, with probability
    scoring rules also available. The core fitting loop is implemented
    in Fortran for speed.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    rms,
    MASS,
    PAmeasures,
    parallel
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
URL: https://github.com/xuduovictorwen/cpmnet
BugReports: https://github.com/xuduovictorwen/cpmnet/issues
